os_meta_head/3role SCRAM line, preserving all old rules, physical loopback port and original501:20:644 ownership. This is an unexecuted candidate, not post-change authentication acceptance.\", \"Static candidate code contains exact parent lease/authority/source/volume/port guards, frozen material SHA checks and exclusive HBA intent; it contains no ALTER ROLE/password reset/GRANT/runtime activation calls. Human already authorized this recovery scope; future post-change probes remain pending.\"], \"materials\": {\".evidence/qyh-current-three-plane-credential-review-20261013/resume-material-0.txt\": \"# 栖月汇当前三平面正式保护身份恢复\\n\\nRules：用户明确全系统恢复授权、231-2隔离/231-4恢复审计、原parent Task/Lease、原身份合同不旁路；唯一m1、先方案后代码，代码仅parent目录current_protected_identities.py。候选A是current directory/runtime/web三角色登录恢复，当前维护Owner与原Host绑定修复已真实通过；候选B为Source reader/锁兼容，需恢复原已归档实验数据。选择A进入合同对账/隔离验证。\\n\\n当前实际三角色rolcanlogin=true而hasStoredCredential=false；这是原globals no-role-passwords恢复造成的登录缺口，不代表已成功登录。原scripts/a0v_bm_runtime_credential_rotation.py提供三角色journaled维护、真实SQLidentifier/literal安全写及保护文件格式。历史脚本固定aos-a0v-recovery-pg/旧snapshot，不直接运行/借用旧身份当current凭据。复用原合同及保护文件读取器，不修改原脚本或全局配置。\\n\\n保护目标文件parent/private/current-runtime-host-identities-20261013.json，目录0700文件0600、owner当前用户、nofollow/EXCL，正好web/runtime/directory三个项，每项exact dsn/password/role；三个原角色、真实当前18446/aos_meta_head，独立随机秘密，仅内存/保护文件/原SCRAM库值，不回显、ENV、CLI参数、日志、Git或review材料。密码不采用用户人类账户口令。原role privileges/membership/NOINHERIT/SUPER/BYPASS等不变，零effect/零activebinding/0三角色现有session。新privateintent先持久化/fsync，含角色+新秘密；任何unknown只读对账，不能无意重复旋转。\\n\\n先在现有owned durable完整副本演练相同角色及精确权限保持，实际TCP SCRAM而非trust验证三独立session_user/current_user/current physical database与原protected relation probe，负向错误secret/跨plane角色/变化文件/历史target均拒绝。clone仅localhost内部、无外网端口，任何pg_hba变更只在exactowned clone记录hash并回读，不改current配置。全650表/schema/序列保持、only三role密码布尔变化符合预期后冻结review；PASS不授执行权，原用户维护授权才是依据。当前精确维护仍先newbackup/zeroexecution/review，使用原Owner权限设置三既有角色secret，不创建扩权role、不授新membership。\\n\\ncurrent实际SCRAM登录及原runtime identity probe/host preparation-only reader通过后才冻结最新API启动候选。当前API仍旧frozen源码，不借200假称接线加载；正式安装apply/verify、八台目录/页面与自然首链继续保留待验收。人类本机OIDC登录与数据库三平面是不同身份，不混用审批身份。\\n\\n当前原生HBA精确只允许现有API/stage两账号SCRAM，其余IPv4/IPv6全reject，因此仅恢复密码仍会被身份门正确拒绝。最小必要配置修复纳入本恢复维护：先保存现库hba私密原文与SHA，将一条仅aos_meta_head、三个原精确bounded角色、IPv4 SCRAM规则插入原全reject之前，现有两登录规则/IPv6及其他角色reject原字节不变，端口仍127.0.0.1:18446。source volume/进程不替换，仅原pg_reload_conf、原owner写入原hba路径atomic替换；保存变更intent/两份旧hba、writerowner，验证原pg_hba_file_rules及actual正确/错误密码身份门。所有650表/权限flags/member/schema/sequence保持。此项取代上文“任何HBA变更只在clone”的初始假设，依据本轮actualHBA拒绝的已授权可修复启动门；不扩大到其他账号或全网开放。冻结review后才执行当前HBA/密码原子步骤，任一未知只读对账不重发。\\n\\n实际RED定位：三原角色secret事务已提交，随后HBA位置断言拒绝，尚无hba-intent/任何HBA写入。候选误读默认data目录hba；服务显式SHOW hba_file=/etc/qyh_pg_hba.conf，默认文件是未使用的trust模板。当前active HBA始终原reject门，原650表/权限/角色成员/序列保持，保护secret文件SHA与原privateintent一致。原execute不得重跑、不得重新发secret。新增本目录current_protected_identity_hba_resume.py，仅在角色credential-present/保护文件SHA/精确原execute-intent、activeHBA原文/两份SHA/权限/父Lease/authority、无旧HBAeffect全对账后继续原尚未执行的HBA一条rule步骤；root写原exact /etc路径临时EXCL→按原uid/gid/mode→atomic替换，原pg_reload_conf，无重启。独立冻结review后才执行，真实三plane SCRAM与错误secret/原probe负门验证收口，不改变其他规则或old12Run。\\n\", \".evidence/qyh-current-three-plane-credential-review-20261013/resume-material-1.txt\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"Continue only the proved-unexecuted active HBA step; never resets passwords.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport importlib.util,json,hashlib,sys,os,stat\\nfrom datetime import datetime,timezone\\nP=Path(__file__).resolve().parent\\ns=importlib.util.spec_from_file_location('c',P/'current_protected_identities.py');c=importlib.util.module_from_spec(s);s.loader.exec_module(c)\\nOUT=c.OUT;REVIEW=c.REVIEW;HBA='/etc/qyh_pg_hba.conf'\\n\\ndef main():\\n assert c.mc.load_authority()['project_revision']=='AOS-002001'\\n lease=next(x for x in c.mc.load_leases(c.mc.DEFAULT_PATHS)['leases'] if x['task_id']=='qyh-full-system-restoration-20261011')\\n assert lease['owner']==c.r.OWNER and datetime.fromisoformat(lease['lease_expires_at'])>datetime.now(timezone.utc)\\n source=json.loads(c.r.docker('inspect',c.r.SOURCE,text=True,capture_output=True).stdout)[0]\\n assert source['Id']==c.r.CID and source['Image']==c.r.IMAGE and source['State']['Running']\\n assert len(source['Mounts'])==1 and source['Mounts'][0]['Name']=='aos-qyh-history159-prepared-data-20261011'\\n assert source['NetworkSettings']['Ports']['5432/tcp']==[{'HostIp':'127.0.0.1','HostPort':'18446'}]\\n assert c.read('SHOW hba_file;').strip()==HBA and not(OUT/'hba-execute-intent.json').exists()\\n con=json.loads((REVIEW/'resume-consumption-r4.json').read_text());assert con['status']=='CONSUMED_MATERIAL_REVIEW' and con['execution_authorized'] is False\\n for path,digest in con['baseline']['files'].items():assert hashlib.sha256((c.ROOT/path).read_bytes()).hexdigest()==digest\\n assert (REVIEW/'resume-material-1.txt').read_text()==Path(__file__).read_text()\\n rec=json.loads((OUT/'credential-phase-readonly-reconciliation.json').read_text());assert rec['passwordTransactionCompleted'] and rec['hbaNeverModified']\\n assert not c.CREDENTIAL.is_symlink() and stat.S_IMODE(c.CREDENTIAL.stat().st_mode)==0o600\\n assert hashlib.sha256(c.CREDENTIAL.read_bytes()).hexdigest()==json.loads((OUT/'private/credential-intent.json').read_text())['credentialFileSHA256']\\n prior=json.loads((OUT/'private/actual-hba-before.json').read_text());assert prior==json.loads((OUT/'private/actual-hba-before.second.json').read_text())\\n old=c.r.docker('exec',c.r.SOURCE,'cat',HBA,text=True,capture_output=True).stdout\\n owner=c.r.docker('exec',c.r.SOURCE,'stat','-c','%u:%g:%a',HBA,text=True,capture_output=True).stdout.strip()\\n assert old==prior['text'] and owner==prior['ownershipMode'] and hashlib.sha256(old.encode()).hexdigest()==rec['actualHbaSHA256']\\n native=json.loads(c.read(\\\"SELECT json_build_object('schema',(SELECT version_num FROM alembic_version),'cluster',(SELECT system_identifier::text FROM pg_control_system()),'enabled',(SELE